1
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:06,000
She's too good to be true...and too real to be otherwise.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Galaxina is a comedy, science fiction film directed by William Sachs.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Galaxina is a lifelike, voluptuous android who is assigned to oversee the operations of an
intergalactic Space Police cruiser captained by incompetent Cornelius Butt.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
When a mission requires the ship's crew to be placed in suspended animation for decades, Galaxina finds
herself alone for many years, developing emotions and falling in love with the ship's pilot, Thor.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
Galaxina, played by Dorothy Stratten.

6
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Sgt. Thor, played by Stephen Macht.

7
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Capt. Cornelius Butt, played by Avery Schreiber.

8
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Maurice, played by Lionel Mark Smith.

9
00:45:00,000 --> 00:45:06,000
Buzz, played by J.D. Hinton.

10
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Sam Wo, played by Tad Horino.

11
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Galaxina is a 1980 American science fantasy-comedy film
written and directed by William Sachs.

12
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Shot on a low budget, the film stars 1980 Playboy Playmate of the Year Dorothy
Stratten, who was murdered by her husband shortly after the film's release.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
Besides its homages to and parodies of science fiction mainstays Star Trek (1966), Star
Wars (1977) and Alien (1979), this film also pokes fun at the Western genre.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
It won the Audience Award at the 1983 Brussels
International Festival of Fantasy Film.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
A film viewed by the characters in Galaxina is a clip from the 1960
Eastern bloc sci-fi film, First Spaceship on Venus.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The clip is used because First Spaceship on Venus was released
by Crown International Pictures in the U.S.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The film explores themes of android, spacecraft,
laser, space travel, cryogenics.

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
